{"t": "open spotify kardo", "i": "open_app", "a": {"app_name": "spotify kardo"}, "s": "typed", "n": "the prefix rule just takes everything after 'open ' literally, Hinglish filler words included - args match reflects that as-is"}
{"t": "close notepad please", "i": "close_app", "a": {"app_name": "notepad please"}, "s": "typed"}
{"t": "pehle volume badhao phir chrome khol do", "i": "chat", "n": "_COMPOUND_INDICATORS includes ' phir ' - correctly deferred to the LLM rather than only acting on the first half"}
{"t": "notepad band karo uske baad ek reminder set karo", "i": "chat", "n": "' uske baad ' is a compound indicator; also no close_app rule matches 'band karo' at all (only the English 'close ' prefix does)"}
{"t": "pc lock mat karo", "i": "chat", "n": "'mat karo' is a negation marker - this means the OPPOSITE of lock_pc"}
{"t": "awaaz badhao mat", "i": "chat", "n": "Tier 8: FIXED - _has_standalone_negator() now catches trailing post-positive 'mat' (mat AFTER the whole phrase, with nothing following it) as its own word, not just the pre-existing 'mat karo'/'mat kar' leading/attached forms in _NEGATION_MARKERS. Was previously volume_up by mistake - see brain/intent_router.py."}
{"t": "kya mujhe pc lock karna chahiye", "i": "chat", "n": "'kya mujhe' is a hypothetical marker - a question, not a command"}
{"t": "notepad band karo", "i": "close_app", "a": {"app_name": "notepad"}, "n": "Tier 8: FIXED - close_app now also matches verb-FINAL phrasing (' band karo' as a suffix) via the new _suffix_arg matcher, alongside the original English verb-first 'close ' prefix. This is the romanized half of the same gap intents_hi.jsonl's 'नोटपैड बंद करो' row documents for Devanagari - see _prefix_or_suffix_arg in brain/intent_router.py."}
{"t": "chrome khol do", "i": "open_app", "a": {"app_name": "chrome"}, "s": "typed", "n": "Tier 8: added for symmetry with the close_app fix above - open_app now also matches verb-final ' khol do'/' kholo' suffixes, not just the English verb-first prefixes."}
{"t": "spotify kholo", "i": "open_app", "a": {"app_name": "spotify"}, "s": "terse", "n": "Tier 8: the other verb-final open suffix ('kholo' alone, vs. 'khol do' above)."}
